WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:05.900
This is Liza, a Blizzard Dragon.

00:05.900 --> 00:08.620
She says she wants 
to work here as a maid.

00:08.620 --> 00:11.240
Th-Thank you for your consideration.

00:11.240 --> 00:13.980
Oh, my! She's so adorable!

00:13.980 --> 00:15.770
I'm all for it!

00:15.770 --> 00:17.490
It's nice to meet you, Liza.

00:17.490 --> 00:19.710
My name is Charlotte.

00:20.080 --> 00:22.420
I hope we can get along!

00:22.720 --> 00:25.240
Y-Yeah. Same here.

00:25.850 --> 00:28.800
I can hardly believe this girl 
is the dragon we discussed.

00:28.800 --> 00:32.230
Never mind that you managed 
to bring her back here...

00:33.040 --> 00:37.170
As for me, I have no problems as long 
as she abides by the castle rules.

00:37.170 --> 00:39.480
Otherwise, you can do as you see fit.

01:00.490 --> 01:03.870
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

02:12.570 --> 02:18.570
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

02:12.570 --> 02:18.570
Episode 7

02:12.570 --> 02:18.570
<b>Meeting of\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
the Round Table</b>

02:15.250 --> 02:16.420
Liza.

02:16.420 --> 02:19.890
You won't be able to work here 
with a halfhearted attitude.

02:20.130 --> 02:23.210
I'll be taking this time 
to test your abilities.

02:23.210 --> 02:25.790
First, you'll be cleaning outdoors.

02:25.790 --> 02:27.440
Okay. Got it.

02:27.440 --> 02:28.620
Listen up.

02:28.620 --> 02:30.490
This is how you use a broom...

02:31.410 --> 02:33.000
so it breaks.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.670
That's why you need to be careful.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.460
Got it.

02:43.690 --> 02:45.210
Does this look good?

02:45.210 --> 02:47.600
Y-Yeah. Fine work.

02:48.430 --> 02:50.550
Next is washing dishes!

03:12.140 --> 03:13.540
Next up, cooking!

03:22.500 --> 03:23.950
You're doing well.

03:38.020 --> 03:39.880
Did you make this, Liza?

03:39.880 --> 03:41.310
I must say, it's quite good.

03:43.650 --> 03:46.790
Oh, I love how this is seasoned!

03:47.720 --> 03:50.010
Very impressive for your first time.

03:50.010 --> 03:51.290
Guh...

03:50.450 --> 03:52.520
Yes, it really is!

03:52.520 --> 03:55.410
Lady Charlotte, you've 
got some on your face.

03:56.910 --> 03:58.910
Thank you very much.

03:58.910 --> 04:01.430
It sounds like you're doing just fine, Liza.

04:01.430 --> 04:04.660
I hear from the maids that 
you're a quick learner.

04:04.660 --> 04:07.650
Yes, everyone's been a good teacher to me.

04:07.650 --> 04:10.650
Is there anything else 
that you're skilled at?

04:13.080 --> 04:15.480
I used to love reading books,

04:15.480 --> 04:17.980
so I have some fundamental 
knowledge of magic and the like.

04:17.980 --> 04:19.420
I see!

04:19.420 --> 04:23.610
Then why don't you take this opportunity 
to become Charlotte's personal maid?

04:23.960 --> 04:25.160
What do you think, dear?

04:25.160 --> 04:27.710
Oh, um, sounds good to me.

04:28.360 --> 04:31.420
Lady Charlotte's personal maid...

04:31.930 --> 04:34.710
Got it! I'll put forth my utmost effort!

04:34.710 --> 04:37.040
Oh, my! How dependable!

04:35.860 --> 04:38.370
Guh...

04:37.040 --> 04:39.050
Thank you, Liza!

04:45.600 --> 04:47.030
I'm coming in.

04:49.210 --> 04:52.120
Good morning, Lady Charlotte.

04:52.700 --> 04:55.260
Good morning.

05:03.890 --> 05:05.270
Like this.

05:20.040 --> 05:20.980
Here.

05:30.920 --> 05:31.810
Sheep...

05:36.060 --> 05:38.160
Haruto!

05:39.930 --> 05:41.370
Look at this!

05:41.370 --> 05:44.410
I've managed to create 
such a large fireball!

05:44.410 --> 05:47.370
Oh... that's amazing.

05:47.650 --> 05:49.510
It's thanks to you, Liza!

05:49.510 --> 05:53.190
No, you're just quick on the uptake.

05:53.790 --> 05:55.530
By the way, what's with the water?

05:55.870 --> 05:58.530
Oh, I was just doing the laundry.

06:01.950 --> 06:06.160
<i>She's getting her other work 
done while teaching Char magic!</i>

06:06.160 --> 06:07.460
<i>How hyper-competent!</i>

06:07.900 --> 06:09.940
You're not tired from moving around so much?

06:09.940 --> 06:13.990
It turns out that I enjoy moving around.

06:13.990 --> 06:15.650
It's calming for me.

06:15.960 --> 06:19.030
Sorry for making you do all sorts of stuff.

06:19.910 --> 06:23.540
Have I been a burden on you, Liza?

06:23.730 --> 06:26.070
No, you're not a burden at all.

06:26.460 --> 06:30.560
In fact, I really enjoy 
serving you, Lady Charlotte.

06:31.420 --> 06:34.590
I'm really happy to hear that,

06:34.590 --> 06:36.740
but please tell me if you 
don't want to do something.

06:38.210 --> 06:41.860
I want to become friends with you, Liza!

06:41.860 --> 06:43.140
Friends?

06:46.200 --> 06:48.040
If you want to, then go ahead.

06:51.320 --> 06:52.170
Yeah.

06:53.670 --> 06:56.310
I also want to be your friend.

07:01.570 --> 07:04.320
Thank you so much, Liza!

07:04.320 --> 07:05.510
<i>Too precious!</i>

07:05.820 --> 07:10.040
I'm so happy! I've 
always wanted a friend!

07:10.040 --> 07:11.700
I'm happy, too.

07:12.100 --> 07:14.360
<i>Liza really is so well-behaved.</i>

07:14.360 --> 07:18.820
<i>So earnest, a good learner, 
and quick to adapt.</i>

07:19.530 --> 07:20.410
<i>Hold on.</i>

07:22.290 --> 07:27.120
<i>Wait, was Liza the ideal attendant 
I've been looking for?!</i>

07:27.120 --> 07:28.080
Liza!

07:29.560 --> 07:31.410
What is it, Lord Haruto?

07:31.410 --> 07:32.680
<i>Winning so hard!</i>

07:32.680 --> 07:34.060
<i>I can't do it!</i>

07:34.060 --> 07:38.530
<i>I can't tear them apart 
right after they've become friends!</i>

07:38.530 --> 07:39.910
Haruto?

07:39.910 --> 07:40.970
Lord Haruto?

07:41.500 --> 07:44.540
Oh, it's nothing. Don't worry about it.

07:45.500 --> 07:48.290
<i>The perfect candidate is 
right in front of me...</i>

07:48.290 --> 07:49.830
<i>Why this?</i>

07:51.200 --> 07:53.410
<b>Anyplace Door</b>

07:51.480 --> 07:53.390
<i>I forgot I could use that!</i>

07:53.610 --> 07:54.910
<i>That's right.</i>

07:54.910 --> 07:58.000
<i>I can have her accompany me to the capital 
under the guise of being my attendant,</i>

07:58.000 --> 08:00.420
<i>then send her back to the castle right away!</i>

08:00.420 --> 08:03.460
<i>I've finally figured out 
the attendant problem!</i>

08:05.080 --> 08:09.020
<i>Now I just need to focus on my 
mission of being expelled early!</i>

08:13.510 --> 08:14.930
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

08:19.850 --> 08:27.110
Guhhhhh

08:20.380 --> 08:23.680
<i>Tiny★Love Cure</i> is over...

08:24.030 --> 08:27.110
I don't think I can think about 
anything else for the time being...

08:27.440 --> 08:30.910
Well, a new show is going 
to start next week.

08:30.910 --> 08:34.470
Lady Charlotte, your break 
time is almost over.

08:34.470 --> 08:37.170
I understand. Let's go back.

08:39.320 --> 08:42.380
Oh, yeah. I forgot to tell you something.

08:42.380 --> 08:46.410
I'm going to be attending school in 
the royal capital starting next week.

08:47.530 --> 08:50.030
What... did you say?

08:50.340 --> 08:52.870
Like I said, next week 
I'm starting school...

08:52.870 --> 08:55.360
School... A hidden student council...

08:55.360 --> 08:58.130
Terrorists... Magical battles...

08:58.440 --> 09:01.980
Liza, I'm going to cancel all 
of my plans for the day.

09:01.980 --> 09:03.830
Issue a summons to the knights.

09:03.830 --> 09:04.810
Okay.

09:04.810 --> 09:05.600
What?!

09:05.790 --> 09:08.670
Convene the Round Table 
for an emergency meeting!

09:08.670 --> 09:10.060
Huh? R-Round Table?

09:10.060 --> 09:11.170
Huh? What?

09:15.720 --> 09:17.400
My esteemed knights.

09:17.400 --> 09:21.960
You have my utmost thanks for 
assembling here on this busy day.

09:21.960 --> 09:24.560
These meetings of the Round Table 
are a confidential affair.

09:24.560 --> 09:27.050
Please do your best to keep them secret.

09:27.050 --> 09:27.810
Yes.

09:28.860 --> 09:30.700
Onto our topic of discussion.

09:31.100 --> 09:35.500
It seems Haruto will begin attending 
school in the royal capital next week.

09:35.790 --> 09:36.840
What'd you say?!

09:36.840 --> 09:37.970
That's news to me!

09:38.280 --> 09:39.360
Why?!

09:39.360 --> 09:42.800
Why didn't he report this to me first?

09:42.800 --> 09:44.840
Flay, please calm yourself.

09:44.840 --> 09:47.700
I've just received word of it myself.

09:47.700 --> 09:49.540
This is Haruto we're talking about.

09:49.540 --> 09:53.720
There must be a reason for who he told, and when.

09:53.720 --> 09:56.100
Why school, after all this time?

09:56.100 --> 09:59.690
There's nothing Lord Haruto 
can learn from measly humans!

09:59.690 --> 10:01.860
After all, he's the Demon King—

10:01.140 --> 10:02.540
Miss Flay.

10:02.540 --> 10:05.000
We promised not to mention that.

10:05.400 --> 10:07.710
Oh... I forgot about that.

10:07.710 --> 10:09.970
What did you just say?!

10:09.970 --> 10:13.610
Is it information regarding 
Haruto that I don't know about?!

10:13.610 --> 10:15.580
I-It's a secret among demons.

10:19.430 --> 10:21.140
<b>Shoooock</b>

10:22.650 --> 10:25.340
C-Come now, Lady Charlotte.

10:25.740 --> 10:29.710
You are greatly beloved by my liege.

10:29.710 --> 10:32.120
Surely you stand considerably above us.

10:32.530 --> 10:34.560
B-Beloved, you say?

10:34.560 --> 10:37.240
Our secrets are trifling at best.

10:37.240 --> 10:40.120
I'm certain that my liege will 
tell you himself before long.

10:40.120 --> 10:42.630
I-I see. You're right.

10:42.630 --> 10:44.240
<i>His flattery is working.</i>

10:45.320 --> 10:47.410
Let us continue our meeting.

10:47.830 --> 10:52.950
The real question is why Haruto 
would willingly choose to go.

10:53.420 --> 10:54.370
That's right.

10:54.370 --> 10:58.550
It happened when I started 
watching an anime about school.

10:59.760 --> 11:03.880
Haruto, what is school like?

11:03.880 --> 11:06.350
Upon asking, his response was...

11:07.180 --> 11:09.100
"Oh, it's...

11:09.430 --> 11:12.200
an extremely scary and dangerous place,"

11:12.200 --> 11:12.960
he said.

11:13.610 --> 11:14.820
My word!

11:14.820 --> 11:17.080
Did my liege really say that?!

11:17.490 --> 11:18.330
That's right.

11:18.330 --> 11:21.450
There's no way Haruto could 
be scared of anything.

11:21.450 --> 11:24.480
So what exactly made him say that?

11:24.990 --> 11:28.100
What follows is just a 
theory, going off of anime.

11:29.130 --> 11:32.840
First, there must be a hidden 
student council at school!

11:32.830 --> 11:37.420
<b>Evil</b>

11:32.840 --> 11:37.410
And they are leading honest 
students down the path of evil!

11:37.410 --> 11:40.450
They make interlopers face 
them in magical battles,

11:40.450 --> 11:42.630
only to crush them using 
every trick up their sleeve!

11:42.760 --> 11:48.270
Villain

11:43.260 --> 11:48.270
And behind it all is an evil syndicate that 
could shake the kingdom to its foundations!

11:49.960 --> 11:53.190
There's no way that Haruto could 
let them get away with that!

11:53.520 --> 11:57.780
Which is why he made up his mind, 
to fight them as the Black Knight Shiva!

11:58.090 --> 11:59.230
It's very possible!

11:59.230 --> 12:01.250
No, there can be no doubt!

12:01.250 --> 12:02.520
If it's a kingdom-wide threat,

12:02.520 --> 12:06.130
it'd be impossible to deal with them 
without someone as powerful as my liege!

12:07.960 --> 12:09.990
This is a major problem.

12:09.990 --> 12:13.340
But I'm sure solving it 
will come easy to Haruto.

12:13.340 --> 12:17.910
I imagine Haruto will install an 
Anyplace Door in the capital, as well.

12:18.400 --> 12:23.330
Which is why Flay, Liza, and I will head 
to the capital to gather intelligence.

12:23.330 --> 12:24.170
Yes.

12:24.170 --> 12:26.770
Johnny and Gigan, 
please prepare for the days to come,

12:26.770 --> 12:29.480
with the further expansion of Pandemonium.

12:29.480 --> 12:30.970
Very well.

12:31.690 --> 12:32.720
Um...

12:33.210 --> 12:36.980
Shouldn't we talk about all 
of this with Lord Haruto?

12:40.230 --> 12:43.500
We mustn't let Haruto 
fret over such matters.

12:43.500 --> 12:46.620
We'll only hinder him if we await 
his instructions at every step.

12:46.940 --> 12:50.250
Understanding his innermost thoughts 
is my duty as his subject.

12:50.640 --> 12:55.290
We Knights of the Round Table 
exist to serve Haruto.

12:55.290 --> 12:58.510
Now is the time for us to make our stand!

13:04.320 --> 13:07.600
That's what happened earlier today.

13:07.600 --> 13:09.340
I see.

13:10.760 --> 13:12.510
Thanks, Liza.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.860
Huh? Ah, yes.

13:15.280 --> 13:17.590
Man, I swear.

13:17.590 --> 13:21.390
If you hadn't told me about this, 
who knows what might have happened?

13:21.390 --> 13:22.400
Um...

13:23.070 --> 13:27.400
Lord Haruto, are you fighting 
against an evil syndicate?

13:27.400 --> 13:28.080
Eh?

13:28.350 --> 13:29.140
Eh?

13:30.720 --> 13:33.160
<i>Liza really is earnest by nature.</i>

13:33.560 --> 13:37.920
<i>I need to give a convincing explanation
 so I don't hurt her feelings.</i>

13:39.390 --> 13:42.370
Yes, I've actually been 
acting in secret all along.

13:43.270 --> 13:45.060
So it was all true!

13:45.050 --> 13:48.640
<b>Okay!
Off to
a good
start!</b>

13:45.960 --> 13:48.630
And I have a favor to ask of you.

13:49.050 --> 13:52.220
I want you to come with me to 
the capital as my attendant.

13:52.220 --> 13:54.730
Huh? Me?

13:55.170 --> 13:57.470
I'll go into further detail later,

13:57.470 --> 14:00.680
but this is a vital mission 
that only you can pull off.

14:01.070 --> 14:02.360
You'll take it on, won't you?

14:05.380 --> 14:08.260
If you insist, then sure.

14:08.260 --> 14:09.570
<i>Got myself an attendant!</i>

14:09.570 --> 14:13.040
<i>Okay, so I'll get myself 
kicked out ASAP, then...</i>

14:13.510 --> 14:16.230
Thanks to your help,
 I have resolved this matter!

14:16.230 --> 14:17.220
Thank you!

14:17.570 --> 14:20.510
<i>And with that, everything 
will be squared away.</i>

14:20.960 --> 14:23.090
Okay, dismissed.

14:23.090 --> 14:23.790
Yes.

14:23.790 --> 14:25.630
Good night, Lord Haruto.

15:58.560 --> 16:01.390
<b>A Certain Maid's Work Break</b>

16:02.740 --> 16:04.260
What's wrong?

16:04.260 --> 16:09.090
My boyfriend told me, "Let's get 
married when I return from the war,"

16:09.090 --> 16:11.400
but I've been waiting for 
over two years now...

16:12.590 --> 16:15.590
A man who can't keep a promise 
needs to be cut off.

16:14.530 --> 16:20.120
<b>"Cut off his head"</b>

16:15.990 --> 16:17.380
You're right.

16:17.380 --> 16:20.110
I guess I should cut him off.

16:17.910 --> 16:20.120
<b>"Sever ties with him"</b>

16:20.110 --> 16:22.790
It looks like my husband is cheating on me.

16:22.790 --> 16:25.060
My mother-in-law is so mean to me.

16:25.060 --> 16:27.920
The old man next door snores so loudly...

16:29.010 --> 16:30.130
Cut them off!

16:29.170 --> 16:30.130
<b>Decapitate</b>

16:30.130 --> 16:31.460
I see.

16:31.460 --> 16:35.300
I guess you need to steel 
yourself to cut them off.

16:37.140 --> 16:40.100
<b>Custom Made?</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:44.310
Flay, how come your maid outfit 
is different from the others?

16:46.090 --> 16:48.490
A fine question, young lady.

16:48.790 --> 16:53.060
It happened the day that 
Lord Haruto ordered me to be a maid.

16:53.640 --> 16:57.720
Flay, that outfit is a bit much, 
so please change into these.

16:57.720 --> 16:59.640
Okay, if I must.

17:00.080 --> 17:02.000
<i>Tight...</i>

17:03.190 --> 17:03.850
Huh?

17:03.850 --> 17:05.480
This is the right size, isn't it?

17:05.480 --> 17:07.670
I'll go get the largest size we have!

17:07.670 --> 17:09.650
<i>Busty...</i>

17:11.130 --> 17:12.080
<i>Boing!</i>

17:12.290 --> 17:13.550
Boing...

17:15.150 --> 17:18.700
And that's why I had this 
custom made for me.

17:18.700 --> 17:19.810
I see!

17:20.650 --> 17:23.520
Lord Haruto, what do you 
think about this outfit?

17:23.520 --> 17:25.130
Oh, nice.

17:25.130 --> 17:26.260
You look good in it.

17:26.260 --> 17:29.660
I'm glad to hear it's to your liking.

17:30.440 --> 17:33.400
<b>I Want to Fly</b>

17:34.510 --> 17:37.160
Flay, can you not fly?

17:37.770 --> 17:40.070
It's not that I can't.

17:40.070 --> 17:42.620
I'm just not completely used to flying.

17:42.620 --> 17:44.460
I want to fly, as well!

17:44.460 --> 17:45.990
Please teach me how!

17:49.170 --> 17:50.660
Okay, but just a little.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.420
Here I go.

17:57.560 --> 17:58.590
Whoosh!

17:59.610 --> 18:00.280
Land.

18:00.280 --> 18:00.990
Whoosh!

18:01.380 --> 18:01.970
Land.

18:01.970 --> 18:02.760
Whoosh!

18:07.120 --> 18:09.720
This is what I can do when I'm serious.

18:10.070 --> 18:11.410
That was amazing!

18:11.410 --> 18:12.890
I'm blown away!

18:14.310 --> 18:15.740
That's not flying!

18:16.910 --> 18:19.070
What are you two doing?

18:20.960 --> 18:22.870
What? Flight magic?

18:23.120 --> 18:25.040
You're still too young!

18:25.040 --> 18:26.910
Don't ask so much of her!

18:26.910 --> 18:27.860
Bad girl!

18:27.870 --> 18:29.880
<b>Shock</b>

18:37.630 --> 18:39.480
You wait right here!

18:43.190 --> 18:45.150
Lord Haruto!

18:45.850 --> 18:47.170
No need to say any more.

18:48.560 --> 18:49.930
Take this with you.

18:49.930 --> 18:51.730
That's my master!

18:52.060 --> 18:55.230
<b>Wibble</b>

18:52.060 --> 18:55.230
<b>Wobble</b>

18:53.070 --> 18:55.240
Amazing! I'm flying!

18:55.240 --> 18:57.560
Wh-What in the world?!

18:57.560 --> 18:58.910
Rest assured.

18:58.910 --> 19:00.680
It is perfectly safe.

19:03.680 --> 19:05.560
Mission complete.

19:06.410 --> 19:09.370
<b>Do You Hate Baths?</b>

19:09.360 --> 19:12.410
Flay, let's go to the castle bath.

19:12.410 --> 19:14.820
Hmm? No need for that.

19:14.820 --> 19:16.590
You're going to stay dirty like that?

19:17.670 --> 19:19.440
No need for concern!

19:22.570 --> 19:23.340
Hup!

19:27.010 --> 19:28.590
So cold...

19:28.590 --> 19:30.320
<i>She's way too untamed...</i>

19:31.000 --> 19:33.880
You're all clean, but now you're soaking.

19:33.880 --> 19:34.860
Don't worry.

19:37.340 --> 19:38.940
That's wicked cold!

19:39.110 --> 19:42.030
<b>The Legendary Shut-In</b>

19:42.450 --> 19:43.890
Welcome back.

19:43.890 --> 19:48.260
Oh, yeah, how did you spend your time 
when you were holed up in that cave?

19:48.740 --> 19:49.740
Um...

19:51.000 --> 19:52.950
I'd wake up around noon,

19:53.260 --> 19:56.180
read the book I left off on the day before,

19:56.740 --> 19:58.810
doze off in the afternoon,

19:59.190 --> 20:02.010
wake up at night and get back to reading,

20:03.190 --> 20:04.710
then then fall asleep.

20:05.880 --> 20:08.020
<i>Now that's an ideal lifestyle!</i>

20:08.020 --> 20:09.190
Oh, wow...

20:09.190 --> 20:12.640
As a result, by the time I tried 
to return those books,

20:12.640 --> 20:14.530
ten years had already passed.

20:14.530 --> 20:16.320
What about eating?

20:17.940 --> 20:20.160
About once a week, I guess?

20:20.160 --> 20:21.670
<i>And a dieter to boot!</i>

20:21.670 --> 20:23.890
<i>She really is a veteran shut-in!</i>

20:24.240 --> 20:27.200
<b>A Simple Question</b>

20:27.570 --> 20:28.780
Lord Haruto.

20:28.780 --> 20:30.760
I have a question for you, as well.

20:30.760 --> 20:33.590
Tell me how this door works already.

20:33.590 --> 20:35.920
Huh? You were still curious?

20:35.920 --> 20:38.220
All I did was connect two barriers.

20:38.600 --> 20:41.570
That doesn't explain anything at all.

20:41.570 --> 20:45.670
Teleportation magic is 
extremely advanced magic,

20:45.670 --> 20:47.960
so it shouldn't be possible 
with just one person.

20:48.370 --> 20:51.060
It seems like it doesn't 
consume that much mana,

20:51.060 --> 20:52.900
so I don't think that's right.

20:54.170 --> 20:57.230
Wait, is it not magic from this world?!

20:58.930 --> 21:00.920
<i>It looks like she accepted that.</i>

21:01.360 --> 21:04.320
<b>I Built an Open-Air Bath</b>

21:06.060 --> 21:07.980
It's so warm!

21:07.980 --> 21:09.790
Yes, the water feels great.

21:10.020 --> 21:13.840
Liza, are you fine soaking 
in hot water like that?

21:13.840 --> 21:18.790
I can handle the cold, but it 
doesn't mean I'm weak to heat.

21:19.240 --> 21:20.970
Not going to get in the water, Flay?

21:21.620 --> 21:23.540
I am already!

21:25.690 --> 21:28.090
Do you not like hot water?

21:28.090 --> 21:29.580
It's only natural!

21:29.580 --> 21:32.200
Our kind don't soak in hot water!

21:32.200 --> 21:34.970
What a shame, after Lord Haruto built this.

21:34.970 --> 21:36.840
It feels really nice!

21:46.740 --> 21:48.700
A Few
Days Later

21:54.070 --> 21:57.320
Nothing beats a nice bath after work.

21:57.970 --> 21:59.580
How's Flay doing?

21:59.580 --> 22:01.830
Oh, it looks like she really likes it!

22:01.830 --> 22:03.620
<i>I'm glad to hear it.</i>

22:04.090 --> 22:07.050
<b>Mana Assessment</b>

22:07.620 --> 22:10.910
I tried making a device to 
measure your mana level.

22:11.320 --> 22:13.640
Will you let me check your mana levels?

22:13.640 --> 22:14.980
As you wish.

22:14.980 --> 22:15.770
Yes!

22:19.330 --> 22:20.850
Wow, Flay!

22:20.850 --> 22:22.570
Liza's amazing, as well!

22:22.570 --> 22:25.500
<i>Demons have high mana to begin with, huh?</i>

22:25.500 --> 22:27.570
<i>Hmm? Hold on.</i>

22:27.910 --> 22:30.140
<i>Char's max level is so high!</i>

22:30.140 --> 22:33.780
<i>Wasn't the Queen Consort 
announced to be level 44?</i>

22:33.780 --> 22:35.500
Not bad, young lady.

22:35.500 --> 22:36.860
You're too kind.

22:36.860 --> 22:40.450
With some training, I bet you'd 
hit max level in no time.

22:40.450 --> 22:42.310
No, I won't.

22:42.310 --> 22:43.290
Why not?

22:44.020 --> 22:48.580
Before I could even walk or talk, 
I ended up creating a fireball,

22:48.580 --> 22:52.130
so Mother has placed a 
sealing incantation on me.

22:52.130 --> 22:53.440
Seriously?!

22:53.440 --> 22:56.060
<i>A natural-born genius, right before my eyes!</i>

22:56.060 --> 22:58.260
What about you, Haruto?

22:58.260 --> 23:01.650
I'm sure he's easily surpassed level 100!

23:04.730 --> 23:05.980
Not telling.

23:05.980 --> 23:08.300
What?!

23:08.950 --> 23:23.960
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:08.950 --> 23:23.960
Episode Preview

23:09.510 --> 23:11.240
Charlotte here!

23:11.240 --> 23:14.410
Today, I made a new friend, Liza!

23:14.410 --> 23:17.360
I love Liza, my friend who 
can do just about anything!

23:17.360 --> 23:19.240
Next episode: "A New Encounter".

23:17.870 --> 23:23.960
<b>A New Encounter</b>

23:19.240 --> 23:22.990
Could it be a new power to fight 
against the evil syndicate?!
